## 2. Brave Search Tool (`brave-search`)

### Command
```bash
brave-search "<query>" [-n <N>] [--json]
```

* `<query>` – the search string (quotes required if it contains spaces)
* `-n <N>` – number of results to return (default: 10, max: 100)
* `--json` – output raw JSON instead of formatted text

### JSON output schema
```json
{
  "query": "string",
  "num_results_requested": int,
  "num_results_found": int,
  "results": [
    {
      "title": "string",
      "url": "string",
      "description": "string",
      "engine": "brave_search"
    },
    ...
  ]
}
```

### Example
```bash
brave-search "python web scraping" -n 5
```

**Formatted output:**
```
