### Fetch Mode

#### Command
```bash
linkup-search fetch "<url>" [--output-format <format>] [--render-js] [--json]
```

* `<url>` – the URL to fetch
* `--output-format <format>` – output format: `html` or `markdown` (default: markdown)
* `--render-js` – execute JavaScript to capture dynamic content (optional)
* `--json` – output raw JSON instead of formatted text

### Fetch JSON output schema
```json
{
  "mode": "fetch",
  "url": "string",
  "parameters": {
    "output_format": "string",
    "render_js": boolean
  },
  "content": "string",
  "error": false
}
```

