## 4. Workflow Patterns for Agents

### Pattern 1: Search → Process Results
```bash
# Get search results and process them
results=$(brave-search "python web scraping" -n 5 --json)
echo "$results" | jq -r '.results[].url' | while read url; do
    # Process each URL
    echo "Processing: $url"
done
```

### Pattern 2: Deep Research with Linkup
```bash
# Use Linkup for deep research on complex topics
linkup-search search "AI trends 2026" --depth deep --output-type sourcedAnswer --json
```

### Pattern 3: Search → Fetch Content
```bash
# Search for relevant pages, then fetch their content
urls=$(linkup-search search "python tutorials" -n 3 --json | jq -r '.results[].url')
for url in $urls; do
    content=$(linkup-search fetch "$url" --json | jq -r '.content')
    # Process the content
    echo "Content from $url:"
    echo "$content" | head -20
done
```

### Pattern 4: Domain-Restricted Search
```bash
# Search only within specific domains
linkup-search search "machine learning tutorials" \
  --include-domains arxiv.org,github.com \
  -n 10 \
  --json
```

### Pattern 5: Date-Filtered Research
```bash
# Find recent content from the last 30 days
linkup-search search "web scraping best practices" \
  --from-date 2026-01-01 \
  -n 5 \
  --json
```

